5,0,1,talk,Sakura,,"Hi everyone! This is like a big mystery game, right? I'm so excited! Let's all be super honest so we can find the wolf together!","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Minako,,Let's stay focused. We need a systematic way to identify the werewolf. I suggest we observe how everyone reacts to pressure and look for inconsistencies.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Victoria,,I agree with Minako. Rational observation is key. I'll be watching for any shifts in tone or contradictions in your logic.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Takumi,,"I don't need a system! I'll just trust my gut. If someone feels fishy, I'm calling them out immediately!","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Misaki,,"That sounds a bit reckless, Takumi. Maybe we should just listen to each other for now and see who stands out.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Sakura,,"@Takumi is so scary! Hehe, just kidding! Maybe the wolf is someone who tries to act too calm, like a secret agent!","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Minako,,"Acting calm isn't a crime, Sakura. However, excessive deflection can be a sign. We should establish a baseline of how we normally speak.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Victoria,,"Exactly. If someone suddenly changes their speaking pattern or becomes overly defensive, that's a red flag we can analyze.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Takumi,,"I'm not being reckless, I'm being brave! I'll protect you guys from the wolf, no matter who it is!","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Misaki,,I think it's better to let the Seer do their job. We should support whoever has the actual evidence.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Sakura,,"Ooh, the Seer! I wonder who it is? Maybe it's me! Just kidding, I'm just a little girl!","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Minako,,We shouldn't reveal roles too early. The werewolf will just target the Seer immediately. Let's keep our identities hidden for now.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Victoria,,Minako is right. The strategic value of the Seer is highest when the werewolf doesn't know who they are.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Takumi,,I agree with Minako. Let's keep it a secret and just hunt the wolf together!,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Misaki,,I'll just go with the flow. I'm sure we'll figure it out if we just keep talking.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Sakura,,This is so much fun! I'm going to keep guessing who the wolf is in my head!,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,0,4,talk,Minako,,Let's end the day here. I'll be paying close attention tonight.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,0,4,talk,Victoria,,I've noted everyone's initial stances. I'm ready for tomorrow.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,0,4,talk,Takumi,,"Bring it on, wolf! You can't hide from me!","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,0,4,talk,Misaki,,"Goodnight, everyone. Let's hope nobody gets eaten.","{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
