36,1,2,talk,Sakura,,Eh?! @Minako is looking at me! That's not fair! I'm just being cheerful! Why are you being so mean?,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,Minako,,"It's not about being mean, it's about the facts. I've confirmed that Sakura is the werewolf.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Victoria,,"If Minako is the Seer, the logic is simple. But we must consider if Minako is the werewolf trying to frame Sakura.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Minako"",""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Takumi,,Minako seems way too confident to be lying. I'm starting to think Sakura is actually the wolf!,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Minako"",""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Misaki,,I don't know... Sakura is just a kid. It seems unlikely she'd be the one. Maybe Minako is mistaken?,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Sakura"",""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,3,talk,Sakura,,"See! @Misaki understands me! @Minako, you're just trying to trick everyone! I'm just a cute villager!","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Misaki"",""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,Minako,,"The divination is absolute. Sakura is the werewolf. Misaki, your attempt to defend her is quite suspicious.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Sakura"",""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Victoria,,Interesting. Misaki is the only one pushing back against the Seer's claim. That suggests a possible alliance between Sakura and Misaki.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Misaki"",""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Takumi,,"I knew it! Misaki is acting weird! Sakura, you're busted!","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Misaki"",""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Misaki,,I'm just being reasonable! Why is everyone suddenly attacking me just for questioning things?,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,4,talk,Sakura,,"Waaaaah! Everyone is bullying me! I'm not the wolf, I promise! Please believe me!","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,Minako,,Emotional appeals won't change the result of the divination. The village must act now to ensure our safety.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,Victoria,,"The evidence provided by the Seer, combined with Misaki's defensive behavior, points strongly toward Sakura.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Misaki"",""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,Takumi,,I'm voting for Sakura! Let's get rid of the wolf right now!,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Misaki,,"This is a mistake, but it seems I can't change your minds.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
